            </note>
            <note corresp="#d587-f3" n="3" xml:id="d587-f3-content">
                <p><ref target="frus1926v02#pg_912"><hi rendition="#italic">Ibid.</hi>, 1926, vol.
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">ii</hi>, p. 912</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d587-f4" n="4" xml:id="d587-f4-content">
                <p>Negotiations were suspended while the Senate had under consideration the treaty
                    signed with Germany.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
